  "limitations": [
    "Cold restart is a new validation Node process with fresh module memory against the same disposable DB fixture; not a DB/container/host/provider restart",
    "Checkpoints add a child-only test wrapper; actual SQL executes unchanged but production supervisor/signal behavior is not accepted",
    "Seed export is prior evidence, not a new result from an interrupted batch; receipts remain untrusted JSON across process boundaries",
    "Separate DB snapshots and cooperative per-batch lock still do not provide atomic pair or continuous release/external-admin fencing",
    "No durable journal, provisioning/rotation executor, archive restore, unknown effect replay, image/config compatibility, signer or custody acceptance",
    "Controlled synthetic project/source/operation/release/generation inputs are not hosted provider attestation",
    "All actual HS/operator/coverage/rate/funding/custody/source/specialist/privacy/S3 decisions remain unresolved"
  ],
